Two definitions of the interference "loss" for the K_a rows (R = 35-37.9 M):
  (a) fixed supply: baseline Lambda0 = K/T, realised Lambda = Lambda0/(1 + c Lambda0/R) -> loss 1 - 1/(1 + c Lambda0/R)
  (b) realised rate = K/T: supply must be Lambda0 = Lambda/(1 - c Lambda/R) -> loss 1 - Lambda/Lambda0 = c Lambda/R (columns above; pre-registered P7 definition)
