Day s6.1 reproductive ceiling (Z18167588 l.60: sum of s over simultaneously segregating loci <= s_max ~ 1.0-2.0):
  active-zone sum of s = Lambda * ln 81 (independent of s) -> Lambda <= 0.228-0.455/gen -> K <= 5.73e+04-1.15e+05 per lineage at T = 252,000 (active zone only; counting all segregating loci would lower it; validity of the ceiling is branch H, not tested here)

